/**
 * While Meson's explorer is down, a swap is shown with limited details from Meson's relayer — no status, since the relayer cannot confirm one — and once the explorer is back the embed and follow-ups are exactly what the normal flow shows, also across a restart. Plus the outage notices: each posted once per ticket while Meson cannot answer.
 */
